# Mobile API auth

- Primary UX: admin **Generate Mobile API Token**; mobile uses `Authorization: Bearer <token>` on content GETs.
- Do not require register/install for the simple path. Keep per-install register/token as optional advanced revoke.
- If no Mobile API Token (`tr_mobile_app_key`) is set, fail closed (`503`).
- Content routes never accept raw secrets via query string.
- Keep page/limit caps (`limit` ≤ 20, posts page ≤ 50, search page ≤ 10).
- Do not run `the_content` on API bodies; keep `wp_kses_post`.
- Password-protected posts must not appear in list/detail/search.
- Cloudflare is the real DDoS control. Do not claim the shared token makes clone apps impossible.
